WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.020
I'm Taniyama Mai,

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.690
1st-Year high-schooler.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.440
I have a job as a Ghost Hunter.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.030
One day, Morishita Noriko-san
came into where I work,

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.700
Shibuya Psychic Research,
or SPR for short,

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.990
and hired us to do
an investigation for her.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.710
No sooner had we gone
to Morishita's house,

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.710
than furniture started
moving on its own,

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.710
and fire started shooting
up suddenly in the kitchen.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.380
It seemed unmistakably like
the work of spirits. However...

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.340
It wasn't Ayami!!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:42.390
The possibility arose that Noriko-san's
niece, Ayami-chan, was poltergeisting.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.730
But what was even more
suspicious was her doll, Minnie.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.980
After we heard from Ayami-chan
that Minnie talked to her,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.490
we attempted to determine
if that was true or not, but then...

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:02.370
Could it be that the house
was cursed by this doll?

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.330
A malfunction.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.180
What's going on?

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:23.550
It's sitting, right there
where we first saw it.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.510
This is common.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.680
Spirits don't get along well
with mechanical devices.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:37.530
That doesn't make any difference.
Never mind that...

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:41.240
I get the feeling that Ayami-chan
shouldn't be together with Minnie.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.870
There are nothing but evil
witches in the house.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.240
Even Sissy?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.240
Sissy is one of the witch's minions.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.200
Who's that?

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.920
Ayami would rather have Sissy here.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:55.590
No, no. I'll make sure
to dispose of them for you,

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:59.210
so in return, you have
to do what I tell you.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.590
Ayami-chan,

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:05.260
were you just talking to someone?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.550
Minnie.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:07.560
Just Minnie?

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.930
There's someone else, too.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.610
Huh? They're gone.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:19.230
I know I closed that door earlier.
So why...

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.910
I see. I guess they don't like me.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:27.580
When did your friend
start coming over?

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.620
I don't know.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.620
Is Minnie good friends with them, too?

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.920
Minnie brought them over.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.630
What's the deal with this house?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.630
Is it famous around the
neighborhood for being haunted?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.970
Or rather, it has something
to do with Minnie, doesn't it?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.390
She said that it was Minnie who brought
over the invisible friend, right?

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.890
Uh-huh.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:56.310
Could a spirit have possessed Minnie,
and is pretending to be her?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:01.990
It could be along those lines.
Want to try to remove it, Monk?

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.780
You bet. Finally, it's my turn.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.070
Naumaku san manda bazaradan

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:12.080
Sendamakaro shata sowataya
un tarata, kan man

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.080
Namuaku san manda botara onboron

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:19.000
On sunba nisunba un bazara un hatta

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.000
While Monk was doing his exorcism,

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.630
Ayako ended up staying
with Ayami-chan.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.340
I hope they're all right.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.020
Noriko-san, what's wrong!?

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.650
M-my foot...

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.690
Your ankle is dislocated!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.980
Somebody pulled on my leg
with incredible force.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.360
A child's handprint!?

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.330
Where is Minnie?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.700
I am keeping Minnie.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.710
Now, would you tell me all there
is to know about her?

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.370
Give Minnie back!

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.040
When did Minnie start
talking to you?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.380
Give her back!
She's Ayami's friend!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:08.550
Ayami-chan, Noriko-san is hurt.
Minnie did it.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.350
Isn't that right!?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:17.060
Don't yell at her! You're terrible
to make a little girl like this cry!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.060
That's not what the matter is here.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.730
That is what the matter is!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.730
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:28.070
Minnie said I couldn't
tell anyone else.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:32.530
She said she'd be mean to me if
I was friendly to them. That's why...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.700
When did Minnie start talking?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.460
When we came to the house.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:49.380
Minnie, this is a nice house, huh?

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:54.760
Your mother is an evil witch,
and your father is her servant.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.430
The two of them are trying
to kill you, Ayami-chan.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.770
What about Sissy?

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.770
Sissy is on the witch's side,
but that's okay.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.440
I'll make sure to protect you.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.820
In return, you can't
be friendly to anyone.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.410
If you break your promise...

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.790
When Ayami would forget her promise,
and play with Sissy,

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:22.750
Minnie would hide things,
and mess up the room.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:28.760
That's your punishment.
That's for breaking your promise.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.800
What a creep!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:36.760
And then, Minnie started
bringing other friends over?

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.440
Mm-hmm. There are lots of them.
Children like Ayami.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:44.110
They're all Minnie's servants.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.820
So Minnie is the cause of it?

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.780
Did the previous owner
die of an illness,

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.820
and their spirit possess her,
or something?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:54.120
Oh, how icky. This is why
I can't stand dolls.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.160
I don't think it's Minnie's fault.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.830
Hey, now, you're saying that,
after all this?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.830
Dolls are only used as vessels, right?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.170
There is a spirit that
is possessing this house.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:09.460
Until we somehow manage
to discover its true identity,

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.170
Ayami-chan is in danger.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.840
What does he mean,
Ayami-chan is in danger?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.220
Mai-chan!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.100
There...

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:24.350
"Bad girls will be punished."

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:29.480
What is this!? By "bad girls,"
it couldn't mean...

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.860
Ayami-chan?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:36.820
Ayami-chan told something that
she was warned she must not tell.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:41.200
Minnie thinks that Ayami-chan
has betrayed her.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.960
Mai...

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.500
Do not leave Ayami-chan's side.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.510
That scribbling is gone now.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.890
Why do I have to be
the one to do this?

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:08.560
Naru was the one who said not to let
Ayami-chan see that scribbling.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.190
Is it possible that maybe
he's kind of nice?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.200
No way, not him.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.200
Oh, nothing! It's an inside joke.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:22.790
And as for Monk...

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.920
On sunba nisunba un bazara un hatta

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.250
jaku un ban koku

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.260
...he disposed of Minnie.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.930
Thank you. Sorry about this.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:47.270
Not at all. Noriko-san,
this has been hardest on you.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.270
Kana-san has even left.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.730
"I can't stay in this creepy house."

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.610
What can you do?

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.570
Sissy, does your foot hurt?

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.580
It's fine. Ayami, once you
started being friends with me,

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.250
the pain went away.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.920
That's good. Ayami's going
to go pick some flowers for you.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.580
Mai-chan, let's go.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.250
All right!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.260
Which ones should we get?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.300
The prettiest ones.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.630
I pick this one!

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:23.260
Ayami-chan?

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.270
I can't pull my hands out!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.990
There's nothing there...

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.650
Ayami-chan!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.620
Mai-chan, stop her!

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:43.280
There's a pond over that way!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:48.290
Hey, now, you're kidding me.
The box burned clean up.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.300
So why did you come out unscathed?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:03.300
Minnie! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Don't be mad!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.350
Minnie?

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.680
Don't be mean to me!

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.480
I'm sorry-

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.360
Ayami-chan!

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.370
Ayami-chan, where are you!?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.660
Ayami-chan!

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.000
Ayami-chan!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.040
Ayami!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.710
Sissy...

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.680
Ayami... Ayami... thank goodness...

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:48.020
Is this Minnie's retaliation?
Is this her punishment?

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:13.370
I've decided to move out
of this house.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.750
That might be best.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:19.460
There are some poltergeists that will
follow you, even if you change houses.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:23.380
Oh, no... Then, what would
you have me do?

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:29.100
Please stay calm. I've looked up
the owners this house has had.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:33.390
Morishita-san, before you lived here,
it was a family named the Watanabes.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:37.770
They lived here for three years,
but left on account of their work.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.110
Not because of anything
strange happening?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.780
Nope. Before that,
it was the Nogi family.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:47.070
There was a girl who was nearly 9,
who died of an illness here.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.450
Before that, it was the Onuma family.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.120
They had three children die
here within half a year.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.410
Three!?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:59.130
10, 8, and 7 years old,
two boys and one girl.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.130
Each one either by accident,
or illness.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.800
Before that, there was the Murakami
family, who had a 15-year-old girl,

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.470
but nothing happened to her.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.800
And even before that,
there was the Taniguchi family.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.770
They had a nearly 10-year-old relative

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:13.810
come to the house to visit,
who died of an illness.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.110
Before that, the Ikeda family
lost their youngest, a 7-year-old.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:24.450
Before that, the Tachibana family
had their 8-year-old daughter die.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.490
That's all.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.200
You don't suppose that children

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.160
around 8 years old are
at risk in this house?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.160
What should I do?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.500
I'm going to call in some
specialists in this field.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.000
If you're going to leave the house,

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.630
then please at least wait
until they come.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.340
There's definitely something
up with this doll.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:45.170
I've experienced it before.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.840
The spirit of a girl who loved this
doll of hers took control of it,

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.850
and was walking around the house.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.850
The doll itself is not
the problem here.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.850
A sitebound spirit in the house
is only possessing Minnie.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.480
Yeah, but listen...

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.860
It's been too long.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.860
John! Masako!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.870
The Australian exorcist, John Brown,
and the medium, Hara Masako.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.200
These two are going to help
with the investigation.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.870
What is this?

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.170
Masako?

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.830
It's terrible...

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:24.210
I've never seen a ghost house
as terrible as this one.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:36.230
Are you okay?
We've arrived at the base.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.520
Masako? Oh my, what's the matter?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:46.570
W-what are you thinking, Masako!?

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.200
Hara-san?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.570
There are the spirits
of children everywhere.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.240
They're all suffering terribly.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.910
They're crying, saying that they
want to go back to their mothers.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.870
What's more...

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.750
This house is collecting spirits,

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.050
and they're all children's spirits.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.220
- Hara-san!
- Masako!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.880
- Are you okay?
- Masako! Masako!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:12.430
Shake it off, okay?

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:21.150
In the beginning was the Word,
and the Word was with God,

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.650
and the Word was God.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:27.940
For the time being,
I've offered a prayer,

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.610
so I believe she'll be
a little better off now.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.280
Thank you very much.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.910
Now then, Shibuya-san,
as for the doll-

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.290
Naru! Minnie has disappeared!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.290
I just took my eyes off
of her for a second!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.960
She's run away, has she?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:46.300
She'll turn up soon.
I'm sure of it.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.980
Naru! The mic is picking
up sound, too!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.280
Patch it in.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.000
Those are children's voices.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.170
There are a lot of them.
How many are there?

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.340
Sounds like they're looking
for Ayami-chan.

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:34.010
I guess what John did had some effect.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:37.680
Which means a kekkai barrier
might be of some use.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.010
Kekkai?

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:42.980
It's an charm,
to keep evil spirits out.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.360
What happened?

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.070
Naru, look at this!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.320
I noticed that there was a bulge
at the foot of Ayami-chan's bed,

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.330
and when I turned it out,
there she was.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.040
Is Ayami-chan all right?

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.380
Yes.

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:11.340
Those voices suddenly stopped
because they found Ayami-chan.

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:19.390
Our Father, which art in Heaven,

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:24.060
I pray thee, God, to take
pity on us, and bless us,

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.860
and to let thy face shine over us.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.400
No!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:37.070
In the beginning was the Word,
and the Word was with God,

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.740
and the Word was God.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:43.080
The light shineth in darkness;

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.420
and the darkness comprehended it not.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.090
I believe the spirit has been removed.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.510
But that does not mean
it has been destroyed.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:01.180
I think it would be best to burn it,
so that it is not used for evil again.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:07.390
This time, Minnie burned up easily.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.440
I think that Minnie's true
identity is the sitebound spirit

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.440
that haunts this house.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.280
Could it be one of the children
that died in the house?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.110
Probably.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.070
They were lonely by themselves,
so they tried to bring over

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:23.740
the other children who have come
to this house to be their friends.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:26.910
And then, those children also
became sitebound spirits.

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.920
Why is it just the children?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.090
Huh?

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:34.130
If they were lonesome,
then someone like Noriko-san, or Mai,

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.470
someone who could be a substitute
mother, would be better.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:41.100
However, Minnie was trying
to eliminate them. Why?

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.810
Mai, how is Hara-san doing?

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.810
She still doesn't feel well.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.100
I see.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.480
Try driving the spirits out, Monk.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.780
Me?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.820
The first girl to die
was Tachibana Yuki.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.820
Here are her birth and death dates,
and posthumous Buddhist name.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.490
She was of the Jodo sect.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:07.160
Nice work digging that up
from 70 years ago.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.790
It was easy.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:16.170
Let me see the records up to now.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:20.510
You really are incredibly
sure of yourself.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:25.180
Are you sure that just by going
to a hotel, we'll really be safe?

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.480
This charm should protect you.
And just in case,

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.850
I'm sending Matsuzaki-san
and John along with you.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.190
Thank you.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.820
Mai-chan, you're not coming?

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.610
Mm-mm, sorry.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.820
Hara-san, how about it?

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.000
The spirits have not noticed.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.870
It looks like the charm is working.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.670
So then, shall we get to work?

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.500
Monk, are you ready?

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.340
Any time, okay.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.550
Naumaku san manda bazaradan

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:08.220
Sendamakaro shata sowataya
un tarata, kan man

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:12.230
Naumaku san manda bodaran, on boron

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.560
The temperature is starting to drop.
Particularly around the bed.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.230
It's already down two degrees.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.530
And the mic?

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.900
Nothing unusual at the moment,

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.200
though there is an odd
absence of static.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.540
Rapping sounds have started.
There's knocking.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:35.880
Naru, the living room!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.210
Lin, what's the temperature
in the living room?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.260
Currently, minus two degrees.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.590
Minus?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.760
Monk, it's not that room!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.260
Apparently, the center
is in the living room!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.890
- The living room?
- Naru!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.610
Whoa, what is this!?

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.570
Shoo! Shoo! Shoo!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:11.250
Naumari saba tataki ya tei biyari

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:14.290
Saraba mottei biyari, saraba ta

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.420
Taraku!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.800
They're in pain.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:29.100
Monk's mantra is causing
the children pain.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.650
No, I can't take this!

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:41.110
What was that just now?

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:50.620
Tomiko...

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:56.960
Tomiko... my... child...

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.630
Tomiko...

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:49.400
Next time: File 2,
"The Doll House" #3
